IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SALARY-CALC.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 BASIC-SALARY PIC 9(5) VALUE 20000.
01 BONUS PIC 9(5) VALUE 5000.
01 TOTAL-SALARY PIC 9(6).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
COMPUTE TOTAL-SALARY = BASIC-SALARY + BONUS
DISPLAY "BASIC SALARY :" BASIC-SALARY
DISPLAY "BONUS :" BONUS
DISPLAY "TOTAL SALARY :" TOTAL-SALARY

STOP RUN.